        "code": { "language": "plaintext", "showLineNumbers": false, "showMiniMap": false },
        "content": "### ⚠ These metrics are NOT wired yet — the panels below are flat zero, not \"healthy\"\n\nThe following metrics are **registered** in `prometheus_exporter.rs` (so they scrape as `0`) but their setter has **no production caller**. Do **not** read a flat line as \"all good\":\n\n| Metric | Gap | Alert (staged) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `outbox_pending_total` | `set_outbox_pending` never called | `OutboxBacklogHigh` |\n| `outbox_dead_letter_total` | `inc_outbox_dead_letter` never called | `OutboxDeadLetterGrowing` |\n| `outbox_qdrant_upsert_success_total` / `_failure_total` | never incremented in `deliver_one` | `OutboxDeliveryFailureRateHigh` |\n| `tenant_quota_usage_ratio` | `set_tenant_quota_usage` never called (emits no series) | `TenantQuotaNearLimit` |\n\nStaged (disabled) alerts live in `monitoring/alerts-staged/aetheris-pending-instrumentation.yml`. **Auth-failure has no metric at all** and cannot be dashboarded until one is added. Activate each panel/alert once the backend setter is wired.",
        "mode": "markdown"
      },
      "pluginVersion": "10.4.3",
      "title": "Read me before trusting the panels below",
      "type": "text"
    },
